gamerule.allow_foreign_mobs_in_cypress.name=Foreign Mobs in Cypress
gamerule.allow_foreign_mobs_in_cypress.desc=Whether mobs from other mods can spawn and live in the Cypress dimension. Turning it off removes any already there. AlphaVer's other dimensions always keep them out.
gamerule.start_in_cypress.name=Start in Cypress
gamerule.start_in_cypress.desc=If enabled, new players begin in the Cypress dimension beside a Hub Door and respawn there, and the Hub's Cypress Doors look like wooden doors. The Cypress gamemodes turn it on.
